React + Vite SPA -> HTTP layer — api/: /api/* + X-Api-Key
HTTP layer — api/ -> apiKeyAuth · rateLimiter · sanitiser
apiKeyAuth · rateLimiter · sanitiser -> Business logic — backend/metrics/
Business logic — backend/metrics/ -> AI insights — AI/skills/
Background sync job — jobs/ -> Business logic — backend/metrics/
Business logic — backend/metrics/ -> atlassianFetch
Business logic — backend/metrics/ -> JSON file cache
Background sync job — jobs/ -> JSON file cache
atlassianFetch -> Jira Server / DC: Bearer PAT
atlassianFetch -> Bitbucket Server / DC: Bearer PAT
AI insights — AI/skills/ -> LLM provider (optional): only if AI_INSIGHTS_ENABLED numeric aggregates only

Client { Engineering Manager / Developer, React + Vite SPA }
Node / Express backend { HTTP layer — api/, apiKeyAuth · rateLimiter · sanitiser, Business logic — backend/metrics/, AI insights — AI/skills/, Background sync job — jobs/ }
